   173	| C6 | `DecodeCudaGraphRunner.capture_one_shape` (G01) | none | replace | The `shape_key` relocation is pure (§4 item 3), so model_compat has no claim. If review reclassifies it, model_compat would own this replace and hisparse would have to move its capture context into an around, which cannot reproduce the context placement |
