     8	  configuration (``get_model().model_path`` and any architecture override in
     9	  the published model arguments, read the way SGLang's ``ModelConfig`` does).
    10	  The answer is computed once per process and cached.
    11	- If the published configuration is unavailable or ambiguous, it raises
    12	  ``ScopeUndecidable``; it never guesses.
